    txt: ['Last Friday my flatmates and I had a serious argument about pizza. Tom insisted on ordering pineapple pizza. Ella refused to eat it and claimed that pineapple on pizza was "a crime against Italy".', 'Tom pointed out that the Hawaiian pizza was actually invented in Canada, not Italy, so Italy had nothing to do with it. Ella accused him of changing the subject. I suggested ordering two different pizzas, but they both rejected my idea as "boring".', 'In the end, Ella admitted that she had never actually tried pineapple pizza. Tom persuaded her to taste one piece. She denied liking it, of course — but somehow the whole pizza disappeared in ten minutes.'],
