  write: { h: 'Перескажите спор или обсуждение (в семье, на работе или из сериала) — 130–160 слов. Ни одного said! Используйте минимум 8 глаголов пересказа с правильными конструкциями.', min: 120, use: ['insisted on', 'refused to', 'admitted', 'denied', 'suggested', 'accused', 'persuaded', 'pointed out'],
    model: 'Last weekend my family had a big discussion about where to go on holiday. My dad insisted on going to the mountains, as always. My mum refused to spend another week in a tent and suggested renting a house by the sea.\nMy brother claimed that both ideas were boring and recommended visiting a theme park. Dad accused him of only thinking about roller coasters. My brother denied it, but then admitted that he had already watched videos of the rides.\nI pointed out that we could do all three: two days in the mountains, three by the sea and one at the park. Everyone complained that it was too complicated, but in the end I persuaded them. Dad even thanked me for saving the family.' },
